{
    "title": "Video Background Changer",
    "description": "Change your video background with one click. If you want to make music videos, Tik, Reels, or shorts this app is just perfect. It\u2019s quick and Simple.\u00a0\r\n\r\nChange backgrounds/Green screen backgrounds like a pro. You can record or add backgrounds to your gallery videos.\r\nFor Advance Features It has a premium version too.\r\n\r\n<b>WOW, Features:</b>\r\n<b>1000+ Backgrounds </b> \r\n<b>Add Music to your videos</b>\r\n<b>Green Screen Background</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Add Gallery Picture as Background</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Prefect Short Video Maker</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Share anywhere</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Free backgrounds</b>\r\nVideo background changer (VBGC) Has backgrounds of videos, and images & you can also add backgrounds of your own. Background from the gallery or app both can use as backgrounds\r\n\r\n<b>Search Backgrounds Online!</b>\r\nNow, You can search for any backgrounds from Online platforms & add them to your videos. The video will be Looking stunning As you choose any background in the world.\r\n\r\n<b>Add Music To Videos!</b>\r\nAdd any Music to your videos. Make short videos, Reels, Shorts, and Tik videos that will look amazing with backgrounds & Music videos. Music Video Maker is perfect for this.\r\n\r\n<b>Green Screen(chroma key)  Background </b>\r\nFor best result of backgrounds use Green screen, VBGC Backgrounds are perfectly crafted for green screen backgrounds videos. Our app's green screen effect (chroma key) makes background editing simple.\r\n\r\n<b>Add any Picture/Video From the Gallery!</b>\r\nNow, Add a Video or Picture from your gallery. Choose a Picture/video & make amazing memory. Video Background changers do it easily. Transform your videos with our green screen effect (chroma key) feature.\r\n\r\n<b> Quality & Speed</b>\r\nTo change backgrounds, App should detect objects completely to replace older backgrounds with new ones. Our Machine Learning It\u2019s playing its part. To give our users the best quality & speed.\u00a0\r\n*To get the best result make sure the background & clothes colour are not the same.\r\n\r\n<b>Unlimited Backgrounds</b>\r\nNow, add backgrounds to your videos of pictures or videos. Many backgrounds are available in the app. You can choose from them or choose from the gallery & add them to your videos. It has made editing your videos more easy.\u00a0Experience top-notch video editing with our green screen effect (chroma key).\r\n\r\n<b>Easy to Share & Post</b>\r\nShare your video to any platform or save your video in your gallery.\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\r\nTalk to us\r\n\u00a0 Video Background Changer loves to hear from you, suggestions are more than welcome to share your experience with us and don\u2019t forget to rate our Video background changer (VBGC) app.\r\n\r\nNote: Video background changer work with human detection. With no human in the video, it won\u2019t work properly.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Change your video background with one click. If you want to make music videos, Tik, Reels, or shorts this app is just perfect. It\u2019s quick and Simple.\u00a0<br><br>Change backgrounds/Green screen backgrounds like a pro. You can record or add backgrounds to your gallery videos.<br>For Advance Features It has a premium version too.<br><br><b>WOW, Features:</b><br><b>1000+ Backgrounds </b> <br><b>Add Music to your videos</b><br><b>Green Screen Background</b><br><br><b>Add Gallery Picture as Background</b><br><br><b>Prefect Short Video Maker</b><br><br><b>Share anywhere</b><br><br><b>Free backgrounds</b><br>Video background changer (VBGC) Has backgrounds of videos, and images &amp; you can also add backgrounds of your own. Background from the gallery or app both can use as backgrounds<br><br><b>Search Backgrounds Online!</b><br>Now, You can search for any backgrounds from Online platforms &amp; add them to your videos. The video will be Looking stunning As you choose any background in the world.<br><br><b>Add Music To Videos!</b><br>Add any Music to your videos. Make short videos, Reels, Shorts, and Tik videos that will look amazing with backgrounds &amp; Music videos. Music Video Maker is perfect for this.<br><br><b>Green Screen(chroma key)  Background </b><br>For best result of backgrounds use Green screen, VBGC Backgrounds are perfectly crafted for green screen backgrounds videos. Our app&#39;s green screen effect (chroma key) makes background editing simple.<br><br><b>Add any Picture/Video From the Gallery!</b><br>Now, Add a Video or Picture from your gallery. Choose a Picture/video &amp; make amazing memory. Video Background changers do it easily. Transform your videos with our green screen effect (chroma key) feature.<br><br><b> Quality &amp; Speed</b><br>To change backgrounds, App should detect objects completely to replace older backgrounds with new ones. Our Machine Learning It\u2019s playing its part. To give our users the best quality &amp; speed.\u00a0<br>*To get the best result make sure the background &amp; clothes colour are not the same.<br><br><b>Unlimited Backgrounds</b><br>Now, add backgrounds to your videos of pictures or videos. Many backgrounds are available in the app. You can choose from them or choose from the gallery &amp; add them to your videos. It has made editing your videos more easy.\u00a0Experience top-notch video editing with our green screen effect (chroma key).<br><br><b>Easy to Share &amp; Post</b><br>Share your video to any platform or save your video in your gallery.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>Talk to us<br>\u00a0 Video Background Changer loves to hear from you, suggestions are more than welcome to share your experience with us and don\u2019t forget to rate our Video background changer (VBGC) app.<br><br>Note: Video background changer work with human detection. With no human in the video, it won\u2019t work properly.",
